{"id":"gamefreak-lineblog-4198886","kind":"blog","title":"【活动】2016宝可梦交响演出","display_title":null,"dek":null,"date":"2016-06-15","publication":"増田順一 公式ブログ · Pokémon Symphonic Evolutions ! （本番）","issue":null,"interviewee":[],"people":[{"name":"增田顺一","slug":"masuda-junichi"}],"works":[],"era":null,"url":"https://docs.pokeamice.com/gamefreak-director/lineblog-4198886/","body_kind":"markdown","segment_count":null,"cover":null,"archive_type":"gamefreak_masuda_lineblog","summary":"洛杉矶现场，增田登台指挥交响乐团，分享相遇的意义，与观众共同庆祝宝可梦二十周年。","interviewer":null,"translator":null,"tags":["Game Freak","增田顺一","LINE BLOG","音楽"],"original_lang":null,"translation_status":"openai-machine-translated","source":{"title":"増田順一 公式ブログ · Pokémon Symphonic Evolutions ! （本番）","url":"https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/4198886.html","archive_url":"https://web.archive.org/web/20160617141449id_/https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/4198886.html","type":"official_blog_wayback"},"body":{"kind":"markdown","markdown_zh":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">太棒了，L.A.的</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">交响乐团！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4198886/001-674f529dd4.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4198886/001-674f529dd4.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n观众融为一体的感觉！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4198886/002-3403eebb63.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4198886/002-3403eebb63.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"707\" height=\"501\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n就在这时……\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n舞台侧边紧张不已的增田（笑）\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4198886/003-75ed49c0c4.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4198886/003-75ed49c0c4.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n终于……\n                    <br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n登台！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4198886/004-b56b78bd92.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4198886/004-b56b78bd92.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n向大家表达感谢，\n\n<br>\n\n今天早上的\n《太阳／月亮》公布，感觉怎么样？\n我还问了大家这个问题\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n                    传达“KISEKI”的含义，\n也传达相遇的重要性\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n然后……\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4198886/005-ea91a094e9.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4198886/005-ea91a094e9.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\nJeron、Chad，谢谢你们！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n                    在宝可梦20周年的\n纪念之年！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4198886/006-6ae169a60c.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4198886/006-6ae169a60c.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1103\" height=\"811\"></a></figure>\n\n指挥！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4198886/007-ab8e522a6b.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4198886/007-ab8e522a6b.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n有尾巴哦！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4198886/008-2105bcfc86.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4198886/008-2105bcfc86.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n交响乐团的各位，\n指挥Susie，\n真的非常感谢你们！ \n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n紧张得不得了，\n但这是\n最开心的\n一段时光！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n下回再见！\n</div>","markdown_ja":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">素晴らしいL.Aの</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">オーケストラ！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4198886/001-674f529dd4.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4198886/001-674f529dd4.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n観客との一体感！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4198886/002-3403eebb63.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4198886/002-3403eebb63.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"707\" height=\"501\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nそんな中・・・\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nステージ横で緊張するマスダ（笑）\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4198886/003-75ed49c0c4.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4198886/003-75ed49c0c4.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nついに・・・\n                    <br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n登壇！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4198886/004-b56b78bd92.webp\" tar